#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on
#. information from add-ons manager
#: buildVars.py:26
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This add-on makes it possible to describe the focused control, navigator object, or entire screen using popular AI vision models including OpenAI GPT, Google Gemini, Anthropic Claude, xAI Grok, Mistral, local options like Ollama/llama.cpp/LiteLLM, and more. It also supports follow-up questions on any description, camera snapshots, clipboard images, and face positioning via a connected camera.\n"
"Content descriptions may not always be completely accurate or reflect real-world information.\n"
"Press NVDA+shift+i to pop up a menu for choosing what to describe, NVDA+shift+u to describe the navigator object, NVDA+shift+y for an image on the clipboard, or NVDA+alt+c to ask follow-up questions about the last description. Other keystrokes are available from the input gestures dialog.\n"
"By default, usage is free through PollinationsAI with no sign-up or API key required. To use other models, visit the provider's website to obtain an API key, then enter it under the AI Content Describer category in NVDA's settings dialog. See the add-on documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"本插件可以使用流行的 AI 视觉模型描述焦点控件、导航对象或整个屏幕，支持 OpenAI GPT、Google Gemini、Anthropic Claude、xAI Grok、Mistral，以及 Ollama/llama.cpp/LiteLLM 等本地方案。它还支持对任何描述进行追问、摄像头拍照、剪贴板图像，以及通过已连接的摄像头检测面部位置。\n"
"内容描述可能并不总是完全准确或反映真实世界的信息。\n"
"按 NVDA+shift+i 弹出菜单以选择要描述的内容，按 NVDA+shift+u 描述导航对象，按 NVDA+shift+y 描述剪贴板中的图像，或按 NVDA+alt+c 对上一次描述进行追问。其他快捷键可在“按键与手势”对话框中找到。\n"
"默认情况下，可通过 PollinationsAI 免费使用，无需注册或 API 密钥。如需使用其他模型，请访问相应提供商的网站获取 API 密钥，然后在 NVDA 设置对话框的“AI 内容描述器”类别中输入。请参阅插件文档以获取更多信息。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The GPT4 model from OpenAI, previewed with vision capabilities. As of April "
#~ "2024,  this model has been superseded by GPT4 turbo which has consistently "
#~ "achieved better metrics in tasks involving visual understanding."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "来自 OpenAI 的 GPT-4 模型，包含视觉能力的预览版。自 2024 年 4 月起，此模型已被 GPT-4 Turbo "
#~ "取代，后者在涉及视觉理解的任务中一直取得更好的指标。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The next generation of the original GPT4 vision preview, with enhanced "
#~ "quality and understanding. This model will soon be deprecated so we "
#~ "recommend switching to GPT-4o."
#~ msgstr "原 GPT-4 视觉预览版的下一代，包含增强的质量和理解能力。此模型即将弃用，我们建议切换到 GPT-4o。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "OpenAI's first fully multimodal model, released in May 2024. This model has "
#~ "the same high intelligence as GPT4 and GPT4 turbo, but is much more "
#~ "efficient, able to generate text at twice the speed and at half the cost."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "OpenAI 于 2024 年 5 月发布的首个完全多模态模型。该模型包含与 GPT-4 和 GPT-4 Turbo "
#~ "相同的高智能，但效率更高，能够以两倍的速度和一半的成本生成文本。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Released in April 2025, o3 is a well-rounded and powerful model across "
#~ "domains. It sets a new standard for math, science, coding, and visual "
#~ "reasoning tasks. It also excels at technical writing and instruction-"
#~ "following. Use it to think through multi-step problems that involve analysis"
#~ " across text, code, and images."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "O3 于 2025 年 4 "
#~ "月发布，是一个跨领域全面而强大的模型。它为数学、科学、编码和视觉推理任务设立了新标准，同时在技术写作和指令服从方面表现出色。可用于思考涉及文本、代码和图像分析的多步骤问题。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Released in June 2025, O3 pro is an upgraded version of O3. It is designed "
#~ "to think longer and provide the most reliable responses. Because o3-pro has "
#~ "access to tools, responses typically take longer than o1-pro to complete. We"
#~ " recommend using it for challenging questions where reliability matters more"
#~ " than speed, and waiting a few minutes is worth the tradeoff. Do not forget "
#~ "to tweak the timeout setting."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "O3 Pro 于 2025 年 6 月发布，是 O3 的升级版，旨在进行更深入的思考并提供最可靠的响应。由于 O3 Pro "
#~ "可以访问工具，其响应时间通常比 O1 Pro "
#~ "长。我们建议在可靠性比速度更重要的情况下使用它来处理具有挑战性的问题，这种情况下多等待几分钟是值得的。请不要忘记调整超时设置。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Released in January 2025, this powerful and fast model advances the "
#~ "boundaries of what small models can achieve, delivering exceptional STEM "
#~ "capabilities with particular strength in science, math, and coding all while"
#~ " maintaining the low cost and reduced latency of OpenAI o1-mini."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "该模型于 2025 年 1 月发布，功能强大且速度快，扩展了小型模型的能力边界，在科学、数学和编码等 STEM 领域表现出色，同时保持了 OpenAI "
#~ "o1-mini 的低成本和低延迟。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Released in April 2025, o4-mini is a smaller model optimized for fast, cost-"
#~ "efficient reasoning. It achieves remarkable performance for its size and "
#~ "cost, particularly in math, coding, and visual tasks. It has been shown to "
#~ "outperform O3 mini and supports significantly higher usage limits than o3, "
#~ "making it a strong high-volume, high-throughput option for questions that "
#~ "benefit from reasoning. Do not forget to tweak the timeout setting."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "O4-mini 于 2025 年 4 "
#~ "月发布，是一款针对快速、高性价比推理而优化的小型模型。它在其尺寸和成本范围内实现了卓越的性能，尤其是在数学、编码和视觉任务方面。实践证明，其性能优于 "
#~ "O3 mini，并且支持比 O3 更高的使用限制，使其成为处理需要推理的大批量、高吞吐量问题的有力选择。请不要忘记调整超时设置。"

